{
  "_doc": "Used by scripts/check-fast.mjs. `all`: changed files matching these globs run every script. `smoke`: always run (the CI scripts). `map`: changed-file glob -> script names/globs. `browser`: files that every browser script exercises. Besides `map`, a changed src/<module>.ts also selects every script whose source or name mentions <module>. `knownFailing`: scripts that already fail on main; the runner reports them as KNOWN-FAIL and does not fail on them (durable-project-*-tdd need reviewed Node launch flags and fail with LAUNCH_FLAGS_UNREVIEWED when started plainly).",
